    "120 会印在片边留白，135 会印在齿孔之间；日期仍按上面的字面曝光。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On 120 it prints in the rebate; on 135, between the sprocket holes. The date is still exposed as set above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "120 会印在片边留白，135 会印在齿孔之间；日期仍按上面的字面曝光。"
