    "作用在曝光到胶片之前：横轴是场景亮度（中灰上下各 4 档），颗粒、光晕和相纸会照常跟着变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works before the film is exposed: the axis is scene brightness (4 stops either side of mid-grey); grain, halation and the paper follow as usual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "作用在曝光到胶片之前：横轴是场景亮度（中灰上下各 4 档），颗粒、光晕和相纸会照常跟着变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 © 你的名字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. © Your Name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 © 你的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例：输出红里多取一些绿，绿色的地方会偏红。在成片上调，黑白相纸的成片已经是灰的，调它没有作用。双击名字回到 0。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Example: more green in the red output makes green areas redder. Works on the print; a black-and-white print is already grey, so it has no effect there. Double-tap a name to reset to 0."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例：输出红里多取一些绿，绿色的地方会偏红。在成片上调，黑白相纸的成片已经是灰的，调它没有作用。双击名字回到 0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
