    "只读传感器的一帧，不合成、不降噪、不锐化，1200 万像素，约 10 MB。颜色和影调和 ProRAW 一样对，白天光线足时很好；暗光和长焦下噪点很多。没有 ProRAW 的机型选 ProRAW 时会用它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One frame straight off the sensor: no merging, no noise reduction, no sharpening; 12 MP, about 10 MB. Colour and tone are as right as ProRAW and it is great in good daylight, but noisy in low light and on the telephoto. Phones without ProRAW use it when ProRAW is chosen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只读传感器的一帧，不合成、不降噪、不锐化，1200 万像素，约 10 MB。颜色和影调和 ProRAW 一样对，白天光线足时很好；暗光和长焦下噪点很多。没有 ProRAW 的机型选 ProRAW 时会用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
