          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在胶片曝光之前校正白平衡，像冲洗前给底片加色温滤镜。点白墙、灰卡、白纸这类本该无色的地方；可以多点几次叠加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corrects white balance before the film is exposed, like a colour filter on the negative. Tap something that should be neutral — a white wall, a grey card, white paper; tap again to refine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在胶片曝光之前校正白平衡，像冲洗前给底片加色温滤镜。点白墙、灰卡、白纸这类本该无色的地方；可以多点几次叠加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
