    "多帧合成、降噪，和原相机一样干净，但留下的是原始光线：胶片按它曝光、显影，颜色和影调才对；不装胶卷时，存进「照片」后也能大幅调整、拉回高光。缺点是文件大（1200 万约 20 MB，4800 万约 75 MB）；装胶卷时成片导出后，底片按「底片保留」天数清理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multi-frame merging and noise reduction, as clean as the Camera app, but it keeps the raw light: the film is exposed and developed from it, so colour and tone come out right; with no film loaded, it saves to Photos with lots of room to edit and recover highlights. The downside is size (about 20 MB at 12 MP, 75 MB at 48 MP); with a film loaded, once the print is exported the negative is cleaned up after the “Keep negatives” days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多帧合成、降噪，和原相机一样干净，但留下的是原始光线：胶片按它曝光、显影，颜色和影调才对；不装胶卷时，存进「照片」后也能大幅调整、拉回高光。缺点是文件大（1200 万约 20 MB，4800 万约 75 MB）；装胶卷时成片导出后，底片按「底片保留」天数清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
