    "推荐 90：和 100 肉眼看不出差别，文件小一半左右。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "90 recommended: looks the same as 100 and the file is about half the size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐 90：和 100 肉眼看不出差别，文件小一半左右。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推荐 90：和 100 肉眼看不出差别，文件小一半左右；低于 80 在天空、暗部会出现压缩痕迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "90 recommended: looks the same as 100 and the file is about half the size; below 80, skies and shadows show compression artefacts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐 90：和 100 肉眼看不出差别，文件小一半左右；低于 80 在天空、暗部会出现压缩痕迹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推荐 · 10 位，体积约为 JPEG 的一半，天空等渐变更平滑；iPhone、Mac 和主流 App 都能看": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended · 10-bit, about half the size of JPEG with smoother gradients like skies; viewable on iPhone, Mac and mainstream apps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐 · 10 位，体积约为 JPEG 的一半，天空等渐变更平滑；iPhone、Mac 和主流 App 都能看"
          }
        }
