    "相纸的高光在 HDR 屏幕上亮过白色：按这卷胶片和相纸的肩部算出每个像素该亮多少（引擎给的曲线）。导出 JPEG / HEIF 时附上增益图，“照片”里看是 HDR，不支持的地方照常显示 SDR。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The paper's highlights go brighter than white on an HDR screen: how bright each pixel goes comes from the shoulder of this film and paper (the engine's curve). JPEG / HEIF exports carry a gain map — HDR in Photos, plain SDR elsewhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相纸的高光在 HDR 屏幕上亮过白色：按这卷胶片和相纸的肩部算出每个像素该亮多少（引擎给的曲线）。导出 JPEG / HEIF 时附上增益图，“照片”里看是 HDR，不支持的地方照常显示 SDR。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
