    "装着胶卷在用 HEIF 拍：苹果的对比、饱和度和锐化会被胶片再叠加一遍，成片会偏艳、偏锐。想要胶片原本的颜色，选 ProRAW 或 RAW。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shooting HEIF with a film loaded: Apple's contrast, saturation and sharpening are applied again by the film, so prints come out too vivid and too sharp. For the film's own colour, choose ProRAW or RAW."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "装着胶卷在用 HEIF 拍：苹果的对比、饱和度和锐化会被胶片再叠加一遍，成片会偏艳、偏锐。想要胶片原本的颜色，选 ProRAW 或 RAW。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
