            "value": "还没导出过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有可导出的照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No photos to export yet"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有可导出的照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有水印。点 ＋ 添加一个 PNG（透明底的签名或标志最好），或用文字做一个。导出的成片、缩略图和观片台都会带上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No watermarks yet. Tap ＋ to add a PNG (a signature or logo on a transparent background works best), or make one from text. Exported prints, thumbnails and the light table all carry it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有水印。点 ＋ 添加一个 PNG（透明底的签名或标志最好），或用文字做一个。导出的成片、缩略图和观片台都会带上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 %lld 张都导入过了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All %lld were imported before"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这 %lld 张都导入过了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个全景片幅在真实相机上没有日期后背，引擎会忽略日期曝光。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This panoramic gate has no date back on real cameras; the engine ignores the date exposure."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个全景片幅在真实相机上没有日期后背，引擎会忽略日期曝光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些是用 Spektra Cam 相机拍的原片，成片已经导出到“照片”。删除后不能再重新冲洗，成片不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are originals shot with Spektra Cam's camera whose prints are already in Photos. Once deleted they can't be developed again; the prints are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是用 Spektra Cam 相机拍的原片，成片已经导出到“照片”。删除后不能再重新冲洗，成片不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些照片在“照片”里还有原片或冲洗好的成片。“只从底片删除”不动“照片”；“同时删除”会把它们移到“最近删除”（iOS 会再确认一次，30 天内可恢复）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos still has originals or developed prints of these. “Delete from Negatives Only” leaves Photos alone; “Also delete” moves them to Recently Deleted (iOS asks again; recoverable for 30 days)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些照片在“照片”里还有原片或冲洗好的成片。“只从底片删除”不动“照片”；“同时删除”会把它们移到“最近删除”（iOS 会再确认一次，30 天内可恢复）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些照片还没导出过，Spektra Cam 里的底片是唯一的一份，删除后找不回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These photos were never exported; the negatives in Spektra Cam are the only copy and can't be recovered once deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些照片还没导出过，Spektra Cam 里的底片是唯一的一份，删除后找不回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这几张都还没导出过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None of these has been exported yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这几张都还没导出过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这卷胶片和相纸会出现在胶卷栏最前面，点一下就能装上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
